        {
          "_key": "3atu1q4y",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "ImagineArt is a playful, powerful all-in-one creative studio that’s great for social creators, product mockups, and character concepts — especially if you like lots of presets and one-click helpers. Pros: realistic portraits, strong product shots, handy “Imagine You” personalization. Cons: occasional artifacting, strict filters, and some iteration controls feel basic."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
