        {
          "_key": "kz1ufxcq",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "There’s a lot of hype around new image models that promise photorealism plus easy pipelines for creators — and ImagineArt advertises a full suite: Image Studio, the prompt-enhancer (“Imagine Bot”), the Imagine You personalization model, and freshly released ImagineArt 1.5 as their newest realistic image model. I wanted to see whether these promises hold up in real prompts and everyday workflows.\n"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
