        {
          "_key": "09uy7wsb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "I ran "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ue7jg7p6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "8–10 generation runs"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k6i6dxx0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " across five common use cases: headshot, product shot, fantasy landscape, character design, and a stylized poster. For each: I kept aspect ratios consistent, toggled Imagine Bot on/off to compare raw vs. enhanced prompts, and noted artifacts, composition, and whether minor edits were needed.\n"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
