        {
          "_key": "87g05zq3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Prompt:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "zybnrsog",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Epic twilight fantasy landscape, floating islands, bioluminescent flora, cinematic wide shot, dramatic rim light, volumetric fog, 35mm, ultra-detailed, painterly concept art\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "xeren8vn",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Settings:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "pcnuq8dv",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Concept Art / Surreal style, aspect "
        },
        {
          "_key": "u1bsx1k9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "16:9"
        },
        {
          "_key": "fuj5rbte",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". "
        },
        {
          "_key": "rb4gk8wa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Observed outcome:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "96ucls9g",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Cinematic, painterly renders with gorgeous color grading. Occasionally the model invents incongruous objects (random buildings, stray text), so use negative prompts like "
        },
        {
          "_key": "m5bkjbus",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ],
          "text": "no text, no watermark"
        },
        {
          "_key": "v31qfrqp",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " and iterate. Imagine Bot can expand vague tokens (e.g., turn “floating islands” into layered descriptions) if you want more specificity.\n"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
