          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Prompt:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "d00jhxjf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Anime character — energetic teen pilot, short spiky teal hair, flight jacket with gold trim, confident grin, dynamic three-quarter pose, cel-shaded, crisp line art, studio lighting\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "qncezq61",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Settings:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7mw1uxpa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Anime / Illustration style, aspect "
        },
        {
          "_key": "8zdt15h5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "2:3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "j95ezsdo",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ao72s7kf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Observed outcome:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "1j2tcfra",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Strong silhouettes and expressive faces. Small details like hands, tiny accessories, or clipped jacket edges sometimes misrender — best fixed with a quick image-to-image edit inside the app. For iterative costume changes, generate a base and then use image-to-image to refine.\n"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
