            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Prompt:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "8lu71lbj",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Watercolor poster of a city skyline at dusk, loose brush strokes, pastel palette, paper texture visible, soft edges, high stylization\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "0x3tuslr",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Observed outcome:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "1w3q0sfa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Great for backgrounds and mood art. To avoid accidental photorealism, emphasize art words (watercolor, paper texture, wet-on-wet brushwork) and lower realism tokens in the style picker.\n"
        }
