        {
          "_key": "btb9fjb0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Hands, tiny text, and occasionally facial oddities still crop up — the usual caveats for current image models. Reviewers who tested v1.5 also noted workflow fit questions for pro artists."
