          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Iteration controls:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7srcddfj",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Seed control, timesteps, and negative-prompt exposure could be more granular for power users. A couple of community reviewers suggested more advanced iteration options would help integrate ImagineArt into a professional pipeline."
